==Russian==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ru|cu|съзьдати||to build, to erect}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъzьdati}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*zьdati}}. The modern conjugation is analogical after {{m|ru|дать}}, replacing the old present stem ''созижд''-.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|созда́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|созда́ть|pf|impf=создава́ть|impf2=созида́ть}}

# to [[create]]
# to [[found]], to [[originate]]
# to [[set up]], to [[establish]]
# {{lb|ru|literary}} to [[build]], to [[erect]]

====Usage notes====
* The imperfectives {{m|ru|создава́ть}} and {{m|ru|созида́ть}} have the same meaning, but the latter is literary or dated.

